 yblod-engine/vk/shaders/common/dv_common.glsl | 68 +++++++++++++++++
 yblod-engine/vk/shaders/fel_chroma.comp       | 20 +++--
 yblod-engine/vk/shaders/fel_equal.comp        |  2 +-
 .../vk/shaders/fel_mmr_dual_horizontal.comp   | 30 ++++----
